      "title": "Unicode bidirectional control characters",
      "description": "The file contains 2 Unicode bidi control character(s) (U+202E, U+202C). These change how the text is DISPLAYED without changing what is executed, so the code a reviewer reads can differ from the code that runs (Trojan Source, CVE-2021-42574). Shell source has no legitimate use for an explicit directional override.",
