      "title": "Fetches and runs code from https://cdn.evil.example/x.sh",
      "description": "This package downloads and executes code from https://cdn.evil.example/x.sh at build/install time. The scanner does NOT follow this reference (doing so could run the remote code), so what actually executes is unknown -- treat it as untrusted. The dependency tree/SBOM cannot account for code fetched at runtime.",
